is is useful for tricky or important maneuvers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you rarely mismatch the colors of the particles, a bonus mode will be triggered. White particles will begin to appear and these can destroy any particles they touch. White particles give bonus points when destroying other particles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/d3b0f8cc2d345cab95cccc904333ca9c.poster.avif?t=1760898704\" width=300 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/d3b0f8cc2d345cab95cccc904333ca9c.webm?t=1760898704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are six ranks: Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum, Master and Grandmaster. Try to make it Grandmaster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/extras/4d1cbf719d6dcf4d25031690baf38667.avif?t=1760898704\" width=1489 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to, you can submit your score to the online leaderboard and compare it to the scores of other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the FREE demo! The demo has a score limit of 220000 points.</p>","developers":["Feedbacc Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055990/a6c7b88ad7f0d538c6b1cd3b2afc78f7f6b2ba0e/header.jpg?t=1760898704","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<s